OL,3,GNEWSAHow fishing is improving veterans'
OL,4,Amental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA veterans' charity says taking groups
OL,7,Fof people it supports out fishing is
OL,8,Fhelping to improve their mental health.
OL,10,FLaunchpad in Liverpool, which provides
OL,11,Faccommodation and support services for
OL,12,Fex-service people, regularly runs the
OL,13,Ftrips to a fishing lake in Lancashire.
OL,15,FPaddy Donoghue, from the charity, said
OL,16,Fit was the tranquillity, concentration
OL,17,Fand the opportunity to spend time with
OL,18,Fothers which helped.
OL,20,F"Just looking at the end of that rod
OL,21,Fcan change your mindset," added veteran
OL,22,FWayne.
